{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/529922-the-ragnar\u00f6k-campaign-scion-2-0","id":529922,"title":"The Ragnar\u00f6k campaign & Scion 2.0","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-27T07:14:18-07:00","id":529922,"title":"The Ragnar\u00f6k campaign & Scion 2.0","content":"So yesterday, I was browsing through my Scion library, and thought that the Ragnar\u00f6k campaign didn't seem that bad. Compared to the Long Road to Heaven, at least. I haven't ST any Scion game for years, and I think Ragnar\u00f6k could be a good way to go back in, and play this game with friends.<br /> <br /> Here's the thing though : I won't be using the RAW system, but Scion 2.0. It seems easy, way more balanced, and I think my players will like it.<br /> <br /> But it raises some questions. The more important being : How should I handle xp and legend raise?<ul><li>I am not good at imagining scenarios, I'm really not. I can't improvise many games and scenarii to give them more ways to raise their Legend. I'm planning on giving them xp boosts to match their skills to their rising legend. I can tweak a few things based on a published scenario, i can easily run a few sidescenes if a player wanted to... I don't know, romance Thrud or Idunn for instance, or just hang out with his Dad for advices, but otherwise, I'm really terrible at creating a cohesive game.</li> <li>I thought about raising it by one for each act, and if it would work well for the Hero part, it falls apart at Demigod, where they only have three acts to go from legend 5 to 9.</li> <li>Should I start at 2 or 3?</li> <li>How much xp should I give them? Scion 2.0's xp costs are different from the RAW game (Below is a quick reminder of those new costs)</li> </ul><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Ability = 3<br /> Birthrights = 3<br /> Specialty = 3<br /> Attribute = 6<br /> Boon = 6<br /> Knack = 6<br /> Willpower = 6 (replace lost willpower)<br /> Epic Attribute = (New Level * 2) + 4<br /> Purview = (New Level * 2) + 4<br /> Virtue = (New Level * 2)</div></div> </div> </div><ul><li>And actually, I'm really eager for any kind of advice.</li> </ul>So, thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T10:04:39-07:00","id":530087,"title":"","content":"*obligatory plug*<br /> You could wait for 2nd Edition to come on out. My friends and I have put out Scion game on hold to wait for it to come out. Mainly because they are all about to hit Legend 5 and get into the ridiculously ugly auto-successes that Demi-godhood gets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T10:22:22-07:00","id":530101,"title":"","content":"I could, but let's be honest, it's not coming out until at least next year.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T12:24:09-07:00","id":530209,"title":"","content":"I think it will take 2 years before next edition will be out.<br /> That's said, you could give your player Legend+6 XP per game or (Legend x2 + 6) XP if you want to have your player grow faster.<br /> We usually play 6 hours per session so if you play more or less you can balance things out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2799-astoril","name":"Astoril","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2799_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T19:51:03-07:00","id":530554,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evilmarmelade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/529922-the-ragnar\u00f6k-campaign-scion-2-0#post529922\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[*]How much xp should I give them? Scion 2.0's xp costs are different from the RAW game (Below is a quick reminder of those new costs)</div> </div> </div> </div>I can chime in on this one. The experience chart for Scion 2.0 is based upon getting (Legend + 4) XP per game. This was based upon a math projection for a single game that might run two years (104 weeks, minus a few for holidays) that would result in a journey from Legend 2 to Legend 12. It would ensure that you could keep <b>SIX</b> Attributes / Purviews at maximum and still have some spare change to spend in other places. It assumed roughly 8 games per Hero Legend Up, 10 games per Demigod Legend Up, and 12 games per God Legend Up.<br /> <br /> After playtesting for many months across several different gaming tables, most groups felt more comfortable with (Legend + 6) XP per game!<br /> So that is what we started awarding =D","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/484-iry","name":"Iry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar484_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"346"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-28T02:40:22-07:00","id":530806,"title":"","content":"Thank you Iry, that's pretty helpful! Now, I just need to do some calculations...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}